WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.607
This query recreates the patient analytics view with
security invoker enabled It

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:12.256
still exposes the same selected analytical columns
The key difference

00:00:12.269 --> 00:00:17.906
is how PostgreSQL evaluates underlying access
permissions In

00:00:17.932 --> 00:00:21.787
a production environment you would test this with
real roles and grants
